# VMware Host Modules 17.5.x

Compatibility patches for VMware Workstation 17.5.x on modern Linux kernels.

## Features

- Linux 6.9+ (`dev_base_lock` → RCU)
- Linux 6.15+ (`timer_delete_sync`)
- Linux 6.16+ (`rdmsrq_safe`)
- Modern Kbuild (`ccflags-y`)
- DKMS support
- Arch Linux package included

## Branches

- `linux-7.1-port` — Linux 7.x compatibility
